OpenAnAttemptTest
├── when the guardians approve and anyone submits
│   └── it should store one waiting attempt and publish everything the release will perform
├── when one proof in the set fails
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should write nothing and leave the account untouched
├── when the set falls short of a clause
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should write nothing and leave the account untouched
├── when the request carries another rule
│   └── it should revert
└── when a place carries another credential
    └── it should revert
